proposal.contractText:
POST /api/login
  Request body: {"email": string, "password": string}
  Success (200): JSON body {"id": string, "name": string, "email": string}
             + response header: Set-Cookie: sid=<cryptographically random hex/uuid>; HttpOnly; SameSite=Lax; Path=/
  Failure (401): JSON body {"error": "invalid credentials"}

All subsequent API requests (browser → server):
  Transport: HTTP cookie (sid) sent automatically by the browser.
  fetch calls must use credentials:'same-origin' (same-origin deployment) or credentials:'include' (cross-origin).
  No Authorization header. No token in body.

POST /api/logout
  Success (204): clears the sid cookie (Set-Cookie: sid=; Max-Age=0; Path=/)

GET /api/me
  Authenticated (200): JSON body {"id": string, "name": string, "email": string}
  Unauthenticated (401): JSON body {"error": "unauthorized"}

